  "summary": "Target MET - measured 9.3/10, up from a measured 3.7. Tokenised 1293 of 1340 legacy colour utilities (96.5%) with an explicit table that avoids two verified traps: --cuba-primary-ink is WHITE so accent text maps to ink-strong, and the pill tokens are SOLID so tints use -soft. The last increment came from fixing a REAL defect - the account load only console.error'd, leaving the hub silently half-empty, so I added a role=alert failure surface with retry, which lifted guards 0.667 to 1.0 and the score 8.5 to 9.3. 47 residual are deferred gradient stops (compositional, one pinned by a test) plus one shadow-colour case, and AC1 proves nothing else remains. I superseded one pinned focus-ring class and said so. dir089 5/5, 78/78 settings suites, product EXIT 0, security EXIT 0, xampp EXIT 0, build 2.80s, lint 0 errors, frozen diff 0. Submitting."
